! GeometryTest.idf
! Basic file description:  2 story building divided into 5 zones with atrium like lobby.
!
! Highlights:              Geometry testing for EnergyPlus.  Includes daylighting.
!
! Simulation Location/Run: COLORADO_SPRGS_CO_USA_WMO_724660, 2 design days, 1 run periods.
!                          Run Control executes the run periods using the weather file
!
! Location:                Colorado Springs, CO
!
! Design Days:             COLORADO_SPRGS_CO_USA Annual Heating 99.6%, MaxDB=-18.4°C
!                          COLORADO_SPRGS_CO_USA Annual Cooling (DB=>MWB) .4%, MaxDB=32.1°C MWB=14.6°C
!
! Run Period (Weather File): 5/1 through 5/10, COLORADO_SPRGS_CO_USA TMY2
!
! Run Control:             No Zone and System sizing.  Runs design days and weather period.
!
! Building: Fictional 5 zone building.  Self shaded, the plan view looks like Greek letter Psi.
!           There are interzone surfaces, internal mass, windows.
!           Building is oriented approximately 37 degrees from true north.
!
!
! Floor Area:        765.52 m2
! Number of Stories: 1
!
! Zone Description Details:
!
!
!                                             *********
!                                             *       *        **
!                                             *       *       *  **
!                                             *       *      *     **
!                                             *       *     *        *
!                                             *       *   **        *
!                                             *       *  *        **
!                                             *       * *        *
!                                             *       **        *
!                                             **********      **        ****
!                                            *  **      ***  *  ********    *
!                                          **     **       *****            *
!                                         *         ***     *                *
!                                        *             **    *             ***
!                                       *                **  *        *****
!                                     **                   ** *  *****
!                                    *                       ****
!                                   *                        *
!                                 **                       **
!                                *                        *
!                               *                        *
!                              *                        *
!                            **                       **
!                           *                        *
!                          **                       *
!                        **  **                   **
!                      **      **                *
!                     **         ***            *
!                       **          **         *
!                         **          **     **
!                           ***         **  *
!                              **         **
!                                **      **
!                                  **  **
!                                    **
!
! Internal gains description:     low density occupancy, <.1 person/m2.  lighting is 6.4 watts/m2, office equip is 13.6 watts/m2.
!                                 Gas equipment is 103 watts/m2.
!                                 Schedules mimic a dormitory.
!                                 Infiltration uses default coefficients.
!
! Interzone Surfaces:             Yes
! Internal Mass:                  Yes
! People:                         55
! Lights:
! Windows:                        Double Pane Windows
!
! Doors:                          None
!
! Detached Shading:               None
! Daylight:                       Detailed in all zones.
! Natural Ventilation:            None
! Compact Schedules:              Yes
! Solar Distribution:             FullInteriorAndExterior
!
! HVAC:                           Purchased Air
!
! Zonal Equipment:                None
! Central Air Handling Equipment: None
! System Equipment Autosize:      None
! Purchased Cooling:              None
! Purchased Heating:              None
! Coils:                          None
! Pumps:                          None
! Boilers:                        None
! Chillers:                       None
!
! Results:
! Standard Reports:               None
! Timestep or Hourly Variables:   Hourly and RunPeriod
! Time bins Report:               None
! HTML Report:                    None
! Environmental Emissions:        None
! Utility Tariffs:                None

